    "family_reading": {
        "text": "The inclusionAI Ling family offers four versions, all with a 262144 token context window and 32768 token maximum output, and all supporting reasoning. Inputs can be image, text or video, and output is text only. Prices vary widely. Ling 3.1 Flash is listed at zero cost per million input and output tokens but is API only. Ling 3.0 Flash and Ling 3.0 Flash VL cost $0.02 per million input and $0.06 output and publish open weights. Ling 3.0 Flash Fin costs $0.04 input and $0.12 output and is API only. The facts suggest the family suits long document, image and video understanding tasks that also need reasoning, with open weights available on two versions for self hosting. Limits are the text only output, the modest 32768 token output ceiling, and the higher cost of the Fin tier. No benchmark rows are named in the facts.",
